{"id":"wb-8-472","name":"张掖东仓","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"张掖东仓","text":"张掖东仓位于中国甘肃省张掖市甘州区马神庙街东仓巷，始建于明洪武二十五年（1392年），民国时期屡有修葺，现存9座粮仓，是甘肃乃至全国保存较完整的古粮仓之一，2003年被列为第六批甘肃省文物保护单位。2019年10月7日公布为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BC%A0%E6%8E%96%E4%B8%9C%E4%BB%93","revisionId":85360722,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85360722","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/0447335fc4d2b70b8496d25c.jpg","title":"Zhangye_Dongcang_2014.01.02_13-41-54.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Zhangye_Dongcang_2014.01.02_13-41-54.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d4/Zhangye_Dongcang_2014.01.02_13-41-54.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"张掖东仓","width":320,"height":213}}